        seven load-bearing terms -- loadDAFoam.sh, WM_PROJECT_DIR, exit 97,
        -u <uid>:<gid>, -e HOME, the exact exec line, the pinned digest.
    (b) SOURCE SIDE: the heredoc region of the runner's OWN source must contain
        no backtick, and every `$` in it must be either escaped or one of the
        seven host values this runner resolves at write time.

  *** WHY (b) EXISTS, AND IT IS THE SHARPEST THING MEASURED TODAY.  A
  product-side check for the item-3 defect was WRITTEN FIRST, PLANTED, AND
  PASSED THE MUTANT.  It had to.  THE HOST SHELL CONSUMES THE BACKTICKS AS IT
  WRITES: the substitution's OUTPUT lands in the file and the backticks are
